  << /ActualText (Apar technologies \055 Onsite at Siam Commercial Bank \050SCB\051\nFront End Developer \050June 2025 \055 July 2026\051\nDeveloped and maintained enterprise internal banking systems supporting branch operations and account lifecycle workflows\056\nMigrated and refactored legacy AngularJS features to Next\056js\054 improving maintainability and supporting a more scalable frontend architecture\056\nProvided frontend technical guidance and consulted with team members on problem clarification\054 solution design\054 and implementation approaches to resolve complex issues effectively\056\nInvestigated backend issues through Java Spring Boot service analysis\054 API logic review\054 and Kibana log investigation\056\nApplied OWASP Top 10 security practices\054 including Content Security Policy \050CSP\051\054 to improve application security and meet enterprise compliance requirements\056\nAchievements\072\nReduced code investigation and root\055cause finding time from several hours to under 1 minute by consistently using commit messages with task IDs to trace business logic conditions\054 later becoming a team standard practice\056\nMaintained 80\02390\045 unit test coverage across key frontend modules using Jest\056\nReduced central review comments from 10\053 per feature to near zero through proactive code review and quality checks\056)
