  << /ActualText (More Studio Co\056\054 Ltd\056\nFront End Developer \050January 2022 \055 May 2025\051\nDeveloped web and mobile applications for enterprise clients across multiple domains\054 including fund platforms\054 service\055based                e\055commerce applications\054 and EV charging applications using Next\056js\054 React Native\054 Flutter\054 and Laravel\056\nDeveloped responsive frontend applications using modern web technologies and integrated RESTful APIs to deliver business features and user\055facing functionality\056\nDeveloped and maintained Laravel\055based backend APIs\054 business logic\054 and CMS functionality\054 translating business requirements into backend solutions and integrating them with frontend applications\056\nIndependently owned approximately 80\045 of WordPress projects\054 managing end\055to\055end development from initial setup\054 theme customization\054 and backend configuration through deployment and client handover\056\nWorked within Agile development processes\054 participating in code reviews\054 Git\055based collaboration\054 sprint planning\054 estimation\054 and engineering best practices across multiple concurrent projects\056\nContributed to technical documentation\054 knowledge sharing\054 and mentoring junior developers and interns\056\nAchievements\072\nDelivered an average 10\053 production projects per year\054 supporting multiple concurrent tasks and resolving urgent issues across 2\0233 parallel work areas daily through rapid investigation and context switching\056\nUnblocked teammates by taking ownership of WordPress tasks\054 allowing them to stay focused on their primary projects\073 also provided WordPress guidance and knowledge sharing to help teammates handle projects independently\056)
